flowchart TB
  C[Flutter Customer / Provider App] -->|HTTPS + OIDC PKCE| EDGE[API Edge / Rate Limiting]
  AW[Next.js Admin Portal] -->|HTTPS + strong MFA| EDGE
  PW[Next.js Public Website] -->|Public APIs only| EDGE
  EDGE --> API[NestJS Modular Monolith]
  API --> AUTH[Managed OIDC Identity Provider]
  API --> DB[(PostgreSQL - source of truth)]
  API --> REDIS[(Redis - optional transient cache / queue)]
  API --> OBJ[Private Object Storage + Malware Scan]
  API --> PSP[Approved Payment Service Provider]
  PSP -->|Signed, deduplicated webhooks| API
  API --> IDV[Identity Verification Vendor]
  API --> NOTIFY[Email / SMS / Push]
  API --> OBS[Redacted Logs / Metrics / Traces / Alerts]
  subgraph Release_Controls[Release and Trust Controls]
    CI[CI: tests, scans, SBOM, build]
    STAGE[Isolated Staging + PSP Sandbox]
    APPROVAL[Human release approval + rollback plan]
  end
  CI --> STAGE --> APPROVAL
  APPROVAL -. immutable artifact digest .-> API
